      "html": "<p>The insurer's engineer surveyor keeps people safe and keeps the risk honest. A crane with no thorough examination, or a pressure vessel outside its written scheme, can lead to a serious loss. The tool you pick should get your examination, and any dangerous defect, recorded accurately while you are still on site.</p>"
